#. えーっと、参加者は６名ですか…
#. そうですか…
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmm... Just the six of you, huh? Really..."
msgstr ""

#. 少ないねッ！　寂しいねッ！
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "That's so few! You must be so lonely!"
msgstr ""

#. 何言ってんだ…
#. 全部…お前のせいじゃないか…ッ！
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You say that like it's not YOUR fault we're all that's\n"
"left!"
msgstr ""

#. 今回の学級裁判で、また減っちゃうんですかねぇ…
#. それとも…
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I wonder, will the class trial end with one less\n"
"classmate again? Or..."
msgstr ""

#. この学園生活自体が終了するんでしょうか？
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...will your school life come to an end completely?"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、始めましょうか！
#. では、自分の名前が書かれた席に着いてくださーい！
msgctxt "0006 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now then, are we ready to begin? You know the drill!\n"
"Find your assigned seats!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、４度目の幕が開く…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And so, the curtain opened for the fourth time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>命がけの裁判…命がけの騙し合い…命がけの裏切り…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A deadly judgment... A deadly deception... A deadly\n"
"betrayal...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>命がけの謎解き…命がけの言い訳…命がけの信頼…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A deadly riddle, a deadly defense, a deadly faith...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>命がけの……学級裁判……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A deadly...class trial...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
